==Event Information==
Celebrate {{Color|#FF0000|'''32 Million Downloads'''}} for the Battle Cats! Tons of special events, sales, and challenges for you to enjoy!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between October 6th (11am) and October 20th (11:59pm)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Monthly All-Star Stages!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#008000|'''Insane-difficulty Monthly All-Star Stages'''}} bring back all of the toughest bosses from the limited-edition Monthly Stages! Now with 3☆ Difficulty!<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Special Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''October 6 (11am) thru October 9 (11am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Ultra Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''October 9 (11am) thru October 11 (11am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Miracle Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''October 11 (11am) thru October 13 (11am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Wonderful Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''October 13 (11am) thru October 15 (11am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Excellent Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''October 15 (11am) thru October 17 (11am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Grand Jubilee'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''October 17 (11am) thru October 20 (11am)'''}}<br>
Clear these stages for a chance to collect tons of XP!<br>
<small><small>※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Treasure Festivals'''}}<br>
Everyday during this event, {{Color|#FF6600|'''double your chance to pick up treasure'''}} in Battle Cats story modes!<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''On even days (10/6, 10/8, 10/10, 10/12, 10/14, 10/16, 10/18, 10/20)'''}} challenge {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}} for this benefit, and {{Color|#008000|'''on odd days (10/7, 10/9, 10/11, 10/13, 10/15, 10/17, 10/19)'''}} take on {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Into the Future'''}} for extra-high drop rates!<br>
<small><small>※ Clear Empire of Cats Ch. 1 to access Treasure Festivals in both Empire of Cats and Into the Future.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Cat Food Rewards Everyday!'''}}<br>
During this Celebration Campaign, every day you visit the Cat Base you will be rewarded with a {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} present!<br>
Play every day and don't miss out on these free gifts!

